{'symbol': 'ILMN', 'date': '2023-03-30 09:15:00', 'title': 'ILLUMINA FILES PRELIMINARY PROXY, URGING SHAREHOLDERS TO VOTE FOR ITS DIRECTOR NOMINEES AND WITHHOLD FOR EACH ICAHN GROUP NOMINEE', 'text': "SAN DIEGO , MARCH 30, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ILLUMINA (NASDAQ: ILMN), A GLOBAL LEADER IN DNA SEQUENCING AND ARRAY-BASED TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY FILED ITS PRELIMINARY PROXY STATEMENT WITH THE SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION, WHICH CONTAINS IMPORTANT INFORMATION FOR SHAREHOLDERS. THE ACTIVIST INVESTOR CARL ICAHN HAS NOMINATED THREE OF HIS ASSOCIATES TO STAND FOR ELECTION TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS AT ILLUMINA'S 2023 ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS."}